[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0564","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0564.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13633","title":"Google Chrome 数字凭证组件释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 浏览器 Digital Credentials 组件中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。漏洞原理在于程序在释放内存后未能正确清除指针，导致在特定条件下再次访问已释放的内存区域。攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制的 HTML 页面，在已劫持渲染进程的前提下触发堆损坏，从而实现潜在的任意代码执行或导致浏览器崩溃。该漏洞影响 143.0.7499.41 之前的 Google Chrome 版本，攻击条件需用户触发特定页面加载且攻击者已掌握渲染进程控制权。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13633"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-02T19:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:29Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 或 Chromium 浏览器升级至 143.0.7499.41 或更高版本。对于使用 Fedora 42 等发行版的用户，应更新 chromium 软件包至 143.0.7499.146 版本。在无法立即更新的情况下，建议通过限制访问不可信的 HTML 页面以减轻潜在的远程攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/458082926","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/96f11c5f4af445468fc4b15b88a4ff3f98a02c73/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13633.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9aee4694c57e6f549d7f2ae075baefe98f4ec05f/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13633.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13633.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13633.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2025/CVE-2025-13633.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/d2420392e74d53848b4edd8107521966d8d48c20/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13633.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13633.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13633.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/b78a15b07d7cb16546143e956ec58c7d8490f0c9/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-13633.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/04ded07645d3d1d1ff4bc7fdbd85d7a922796dcd/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-136xx/CVE-2025-13633.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0564.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0563","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0563.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13632","title":"Google Chrome DevTools 沙箱逃逸漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 浏览器 143.0.7499.41 之前的 DevTools（开发者工具）中存在实现不当的漏洞。该漏洞允许攻击者通过诱导用户安装特制的恶意扩展程序，利用 DevTools 的缺陷实现沙箱逃逸（Sandbox Escape）。攻击者在用户安装恶意扩展的条件下，可通过精心构建的扩展功能绕过浏览器安全隔离机制，从而在目标系统上执行潜在的非法操作或获取更高权限。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本的 Chromium 浏览器用户，危害等级为高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13632"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-02T19:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:28Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 浏览器升级至 143.0.7499.41 或更高版本。对于使用 Chromium 的用户，请更新至 chromium-143.0.7499.146 及以上版本。在更新完成前，建议用户谨慎安装来源不明的浏览器扩展程序，以防止攻击者通过恶意扩展诱导触发沙箱逃逸。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/439058242","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2025/CVE-2025-13632.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/96f11c5f4af445468fc4b15b88a4ff3f98a02c73/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13632.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/86584358a36e2820138eead136e8b25a18d9917a/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13632.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b18a069a6f64168900db1bdcf67a526ee6f9b5af/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13632.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2025/CVE-2025-13632.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/d2420392e74d53848b4edd8107521966d8d48c20/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13632.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b18a069a6f64168900db1bdcf67a526ee6f9b5af/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13632.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13632.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13632.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/b78a15b07d7cb16546143e956ec58c7d8490f0c9/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-13632.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0563.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0561","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0561.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13631","title":"Google Chrome Google Updater 权限提升漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 的 Google Updater 组件在实现上存在不恰当的处理逻辑，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意文件向目标发送特制载荷，触发该漏洞并实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Mac 平台上 Google Chrome 143.0.7499.41 及之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可发起远程攻击，但需要用户交互才能完成利用流程。成功利用后，攻击者可获得系统级权限，完全影响目标系统的机密性、完整性和可用性，CVSS 评分为 8.8，危害等级高。Google 已在新版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13631"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-02T19:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:28Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 143.0.7499.41 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Google Updater 中的权限提升漏洞。在 macOS 上，打开 Chrome 点击「关于 Google Chrome」触发自动更新，或通过终端执行 `google-chrome --version` 确认版本号。已部署环境可通过 MDM 策略强制推送更新。如暂时无法升级，可在终端中对 Google Updater 进程施加沙盒限制（`sandbox-exec` 配置文件禁止其写入敏感目录），并禁用非必要用户的 Chrome 自动更新权限以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/448113221","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2025/CVE-2025-13631.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7385b01d60e95b8b46a82603445449e7e74907b4/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13631.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13631.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8ea97a2f0801990574114178f603d7ac60f28c37/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13631.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-13631.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8ea97a2f0801990574114178f603d7ac60f28c37/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13631.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2025/CVE-2025-13631.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13631.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13631.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13631.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0561.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0560","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0560.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13630","title":"Google Chrome V8 类型混淆漏洞","description":"tags format.<value>Google Chrome 的 V8 JavaScript 引擎存在类型混淆漏洞（CVE-2025-13630，CWE-843）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制的 HTML 页面，利用该漏洞触发堆内存破坏，进而可能实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 143.0.7499.41 之前的所有版本。Google 已在 Chrome 143.0.7499.41 版本中修复此漏洞，用户应及时更新浏览器以消除安全风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13630"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-02T19:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:28Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 143.0.7499.41 或更高版本。Windows 用户可通过 Google Chrome 浏览器设置中的「关于 Chrome」自动检测并安装更新；Linux 用户请通过系统包管理器执行 `sudo apt update && sudo apt install chromium-browser`（Debian/Ubuntu）或 `sudo dnf update chromium`（Fedora/RHEL）更新至 143.0.7499.146 及以上版本。更新完成后重启浏览器。在补丁部署前，建议在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 执行作为临时缓解措施，具体操作为：设置 → 隐私和安全 → 站点设置 → JavaScript → 阻止所有站点运行 JavaScript。确认更新后在地址栏输入 `chrome://version` 验证版本号已升至 143.0.7499.41 或以上。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/456547591","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2025/CVE-2025-13630.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b3c35d89abde60a88f7cb8e626161de34dd6ab36/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13630.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13630.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13630.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2025/CVE-2025-13630.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13630.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13630.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13630.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13630.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/b78a15b07d7cb16546143e956ec58c7d8490f0c9/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-13630.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0560.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0431","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0431.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-10543","title":"Eclipse Paho Go MQTT 库整数截断导致数据泄露漏洞","description":"Eclipse Paho Go MQTT v3.1 库（paho.mqtt.golang）1.5.0 及之前版本存在整数截断漏洞。当传入的 UTF-8 编码字符串长度超过 65535 字节时，库在将 int64/int32 类型长度值转换为 int16 时未进行溢出检查，导致写入的数据量超出长度字段指示范围。攻击者可通过向 MQTT 服务器发送特制的超长 UTF-8 字符串（如主题字段），造成数据包结构损坏或敏感数据泄露（例如主题内容泄露到 PUBLISH 消息体中）。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响库的 MQTT 客户端应用，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-10543"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-02T09:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:28:29Z","remediation":"立即将 paho.mqtt.golang 升级至 v1.5.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复整数截断导致的协议走私漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对 MQTT 主题和负载长度进行校验，拒绝长度超过 65535 字节的 UTF-8 字符串输入，并限制单个 PUBLISH 报文的数据量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gitlab.eclipse.org/security/vulnerability-reports/-/issues/254","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10543.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12ccf92eecf2db493c63630fd06d8245f1d02476/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10543.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/eclipse/paho.mqtt.golang/CVE-2025-10543.yml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-10543","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-10543.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2025-4173.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/github-reviewed/2025/12/GHSA-32fw-gq77-f2f2/GHSA-32fw-gq77-f2f2.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2025-10543","https://github.com/gfnord/chirpstack-iothub-bridge/blob/be8ebd041c20ce1611c0987fe9a15d0b56ecb527/README.md","https://github.com/FraunhoferIOSB/FAAAST-Service/blob/c8da6eb177d589797d2a61a17a4061008e95825f/owaspSuppressions.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0431.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-20