oc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0367.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0366","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0366.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-58487","title":"Samsung Samsung Account 授权不当漏洞","description":"Samsung Account 应用（版本 15.5.01.1 之前）存在授权不当漏洞。本地攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，以 Samsung Account 权限启动任意 Activity，可能导致应用功能被非授权调用或服务异常。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，但需要本地访问权限。CVSS 评分 4.0，危害等级中危。用户应将 Samsung Account 更新至 15.5.01.1 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-58487"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2025-12-02T02:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:44:33Z","remediation":"立即将 Samsung Account 升级至 15.5.01.1 或更高版本，可通过 Galaxy Store 或系统设置中的应用更新模块执行升级。如无法立即更新，可在设置中限制 Samsung Account 的权限，仅授予必要权限，并关闭\"允许未知来源活动\"选项以降低本地攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://security.samsungmobile.com/serviceWeb.smsb?year=2025&month=12","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2025/58xxx/CVE-2025-58487.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2025/58xxx/CVE-2025-58487.json","https://github.com/MaliciousErection/maliciouserection.github.io/blob/b520cc90e18d6b4d0ee96300aafc87c0bf5b2524/_cves/2025-03-01_cve-2025-58487.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-58487.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/12/GHSA-vmqx-6q38-x643/GHSA-vmqx-6q38-x643.json","https://github.com/Ch0pin/related_work/blob/e61545555f305c905c522609d078a64379ac4fbd/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-58487.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-58487.json","https://github.com/apmatlock/apmatlock.github.io/blob/e0bce2c649e4fe2d2f33612ba5ea8d9dc17c9543/cybersecnews/2026-03-23.html","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/6ca409c176d64774782bd4356ed8947593e3b94d/advisories/2025/12/EUVD-2025-200131.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0366.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0365","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0365.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-58486","title":"Samsung Account 输入验证不当漏洞","description":"Samsung Account（三星账户）存在输入验证不当漏洞，版本低于 15.5.01.1 的 Samsung Account 未能对用户输入进行充分校验，导致本地攻击者可利用该漏洞在目标设备上执行任意脚本。攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需用户交互即可触发，影响用户账户数据的机密性。三星已在后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-58486"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2025-12-02T02:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:44:33Z","remediation":"立即将 Samsung Account 更新至 15.5.01.1 或更高版本，可通过 Galaxy Store → 菜单 → 更新 或 设置 → 应用 → Samsung Account → 检查更新 完成升级。如无法立即更新，可在设置中禁用 Samsung Account 的自动脚本执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://security.samsungmobile.com/serviceWeb.smsb?year=2025&month=12","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2025/58xxx/CVE-2025-58486.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2025/58xxx/CVE-2025-58486.json","https://github.com/MaliciousErection/maliciouserection.github.io/blob/b520cc90e18d6b4d0ee96300aafc87c0bf5b2524/_cves/2025-03-01_cve-2025-58486.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-58486.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/12/GHSA-r68g-vcqm-77rw/GHSA-r68g-vcqm-77rw.json","https://github.com/Ch0pin/related_work/blob/e61545555f305c905c522609d078a64379ac4fbd/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-58486.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-58486.json","https://github.com/paddedzero/archive-feedmeup/blob/e35162cfc6b997cb93757b8d910d234c6d2b16dd/_posts/2026-03-29-05-04-weekly-scan.md","https://github.com/apmatlock/apmatlock.github.io/blob/e0bce2c649e4fe2d2f33612ba5ea8d9dc17c9543/cybersecnews/2026-03-23.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0365.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0582","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0582.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13837","title":"Python plistlib 加载Plist文件时内存不足导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Python 的 plistlib 模块在加载 Plist 文件时，按照文件自身指定的大小读取数据，未对输入大小进行限制验证。攻击者可构造恶意 Plist 文件，指定极大的尺寸值，诱使模块尝试分配过量内存，导致内存耗尽（OOM）并引发拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响使用 Python 处理不受信任 Plist 文件的所有应用场景，攻击条件为受害者加载了特制的恶意 Plist 文件。CWE 编号为 CWE-400（资源消耗失控），CVSS 评分为 2.1 等级为低危。Debian 与 SUSE 已发布安全通告，建议用户更新 Python 包至修复版本以缓解风险。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13837"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-01T18:16:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:50Z","remediation":"升级至 Python 3.11.15 或更高版本（包括 3.12.x、3.13.x），该版本已合入修复分块读取大数据的补丁，可防止恶意构造的 plist 文件触发内存耗尽。建议通过系统包管理器或 pip 执行：执行 pip install --upgrade python 或使用 apt/yum 更新至对应版本。如无法立即升级，应避免从不受信任的来源加载 plist 文件作为临时缓解措施，同时监控进程内存使用，防止 OOM 导致系统不可用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/568342cfc8f002d9a15f30238f26b9d2e0e79036","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/5a8b19677d818fb41ee55f310233772e15aa1a2b","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/694922cf40aa3a28f898b5f5ee08b71b4922df70","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/71fa8eb8233b37f16c88b6e3e583b461b205d1ba","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/b64441e4852383645af5b435411a6f849dd1b4cb","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/cefee7d118a26ef6cd43db59bb9d98ca9a331111","https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/119342","https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/119343","https://mail.python.org/archives/list/security-announce@python.org/thread/2X5IBCJXRQAZ5PSERLHMSJFBHFR3QM2C/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/002f445c117788eccca176fc25679a0054ff81a3/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13837.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ab0d3409b603db1796a3b851a886f8cdf7b31ac5/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13837.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/de1ee663b3df0d1f1b578bbafc4a2ebfacf8048e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13837.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2025/CVE-2025-13837.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/de1ee663b3df0d1f1b578bbafc4a2ebfacf8048e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13837.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/418f362bf2ed654c73aee7f7f643d90e21e1b6c2/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-13837.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13837.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13837.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/4fcce57814a6bcc1b5ad93155757af13b5f790e9/2025/CVE-2025-13837.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e03c5655bebd4c9a948dcb1b37e1e76b72295ca6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-13837"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0582.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0581","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0581.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13836","title":"Python http.client 内存溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"该漏洞位于 Python 标准库的 `http.client` 模块中。当客户端在读取 HTTP 响应且未指定读取量时，默认行为会信任响应头中的 `Content-Length` 字段。恶意服务器可通过发送一个包含极大 `Content-Length` 值的响应，诱导客户端将大量数据加载到内存中，从而导致内存溢出（OOM）或拒绝服务（DoS）攻击。该漏洞影响使用 `http.client` 进行网络请求的 Python 应用，攻击条件为客户端与恶意服务器建立连接并接收响应。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13836"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-01T18:16:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:50Z","remediation":"建议将 Python 升级至 3.11.15 或更高版本。在无法立即升级的环境中，建议在调用 http.client 读取响应时，显式指定读取字节数而非依赖默认的 Content-Length，或在应用层增加对响应体大小的严格校验以防止内存溢出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/14b1fdb0a94b96f86fc7b86671ea9582b8676628","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/289f29b0fe38baf2d7cb5854f4bb573cc34a6a15","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/4ce27904b597c77d74dd93f2c912676021a99155","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/5a4c4a033a4a54481be6870aa1896fad732555b5","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/5dc101675fd22918facbbe0fecdc821502beaaf0","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/afc40bdd3dd71f343fd9016f6d8eebbacbd6587c","https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/119451","https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/119454","https://mail.python.org/archives/list/security-announce@python.org/thread/OQ6G7MKRQIS3OAREC3HNG3D2DPOU34XO/","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/5b489b870c33d1994a0ca66312666b701817a419/specs/p/python3.11/00472-cve-2025-13836.patch","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/5b489b870c33d1994a0ca66312666b701817a419/specs/p/python3.12/00472-cve-2025-13836.patch","https://github.com/saltstack/salt/blob/c3e5bb1981a025a69bf94269282838ab618079c8/doc/topics/releases/3007.11.md","https://github.com/saltstack/salt/blob/c3e5bb1981a025a69bf94269282838ab618079c8/doc/topics/releases/3006.19.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b55a0e6faed5f81ed4c75a7b8a6ed2ea8e5965a3/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13836.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6e7571de2d083c2588093ee3ef73d1501282312b/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13836.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/041916a4bbe5f9cbf864643dca3b8c710245f3cd/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13836.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2025/CVE-2025-13836.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/041916a4bbe5f9cbf864643dca3b8c710245f3cd/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13836.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13836.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0581.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0528","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0528.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12638","title":"Keras keras.utils.get_file() 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Keras 3.11.3 版本的 `keras.utils.get_file()` 函数在处理 tar 归档文件时存在路径遍历漏洞。该函数使用 Python 的 `tarfile.extractall()` 方法解压文件，但未设置安全关键的 `filter='data'` 参数。虽然 Keras 尝试通过 `filter_safe_paths()` 过滤不安全路径，但该过滤发生在解压之前，而解压过程中存在 PATH_MAX 符号链接解析缺陷，导致路径长度限制使符号链接解析失败，从而绕过安全检查，将文件写入预期解压目录之外。攻击者可利用特制的 tar 归档文件，通过诱导用户调用 `get_file()` 处理恶意归档，实现向缓存目录外任意位置写入文件，可能导致系统被入侵或恶意代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.0，危害等级高，影响 Keras 3.11.3 及之前版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12638"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-28T15:16:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:32:43Z","remediation":"升级 Keras 至已修复版本（如官方发布补丁后升级至 3.11.4 或更高版本）。如无法立即升级，在调用 `keras.utils.get_file()` 处理 tar 归档时，手动为 `tarfile.extractall()` 添加 `filter='data'` 参数，或避免从不可信来源下载并解压 tar 文件。作为临时缓解措施，可在应用层对 `get_file()` 的下载路径和文件类型进行白名单校验，限制解压目标目录的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://huntr.com/bounties/f94f5beb-54d8-4e6a-8bac-86d9aee103f4","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12638.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12638.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12638.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12638.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12638.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12638.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/GHSA/data/2025/CVE-2025-12638.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/c767f5a01a86c6edf083aea94b31404ef6037d33/doc/2026-01/【漏洞分析】Keras 路径遍历漏洞（CVE-2025-12638）.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-12638.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12638.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0528.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0559","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0559.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13601","title":"GNOME GLib g_escape_uri_string 整数溢出漏洞","description":"GLib 库中的 g_escape_uri_string() 函数存在整数溢出漏洞，由于在计算转义后字符串长度时未正确处理大量需要转义的特殊字符，导致缓冲区大小计算错误，可能引发堆溢出。攻击者可构造包含大量需转义字符的恶意 URI 字符串，触发该漏洞导致内存写入越界，进而可能实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响使用 GLib 库的所有应用程序，尤其影响 SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 等发行版中的 glib2 包。CVSS 评分为 7.7（高危），攻击复杂度为低，无需身份认证即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13601"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-26T15:15:51Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:52Z","remediation":"升级 GLib 到最新版本：Ubuntu 用户运行 `sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade libglib2.0-0` 至至少 2.74.6 版本（或 2.80+）；Fedora 用户运行 `sudo dnf upgrade glib2` 至 2.78.5+ 版本；CentOS/RHEL 执行 `sudo yum update glib2` 至 2.71.4+。对于 SUSE 用户使用 `zypper patch SUSE-SU-2025:4442-1` 应用安全补丁。对于 Debian 用户运行 `apt-get install glib2.0` 更新至 ≥2.74.6。此外，建议检查系统中所有依赖 GLib 的应用和服务，运行 `ldd $(which your-application)` 验证实际版本。同时，可以通过向防火墙添加规则阻止对 GLib 服务的高频或特殊字符字符串输入来临时缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0936","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0975","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0991","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1323","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1324","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1326","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1327","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1465","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1608","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1624","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1625","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1626","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1627","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1652","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1736","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:18344","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:18705","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2064","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2072","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2485","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2563","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2633","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2659","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2671","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2974","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:3415","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:4419","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:7461","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-13601","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2416741","https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/glib/-/issues/3827","https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/glib/-/merge_requests/4914","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-253495.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2025/CVE-2025-13601.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b3c35d89abde60a88f7cb8e626161de34dd6ab36/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13601.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13601.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13601.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-13601.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-13601.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13601.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-13601","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/cb271a5f404b60f448823d22fb771b555bac99d2/specs/g/glib2/glib2.spec","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13601.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0559.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0559.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0559.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0535","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0535.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12816","title":"digitalbazaar node-forge 解释冲突导致密码学验证绕过漏洞","description":"node-forge 1.3.1 及更早版本存在 ASN.1 解析时的解释冲突漏洞（CWE-436），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造恶意 ASN.1 结构，导致模式验证不同步，产生语义分歧，进而绕过下游加密验证和安全决策。该漏洞影响使用 node-forge ≤1.3.1 的所有项目，包括 openSUSE 16、Ubuntu、TeslaMate 等依赖该库的产品。攻击者无需认证、无需用户交互，通过网络即可远程发起攻击（CVSS 3.1 AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:N/I:H/A:N，评分 8.6 HIGH），主要影响完整性，可能导致证书验证绕过、签名伪造等安全决策失效。官方已在 node-forge 3.5.0 及后续版本修复，相关发行版已发布安全更新（openSUSE-SU-2026:20177-1、Ubuntu CVE-2025-12816、TeslaMate 更新等）。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12816"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-25T20:15:58Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:32:59Z","remediation":"升级 node-forge 到 1.3.2 或以上版本，通过运行 `npm install node-forge@1.3.2` 或在 package.json 中修改版本号来更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/digitalbazaar/forge","https://github.com/digitalbazaar/forge/pull/1124","https://github.com/digitalbazaar/forge/security/advisories/GHSA-5gfm-wpxj-wjgq","https://kb.cert.org/vuls/id/521113","https://www.npmjs.com/package/node-forge","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/521113","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12816.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54d76ab772484c9516adea70c89afaeb5255051/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12816.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/279583be34c6d843b0dc5c18439662dc1902e505/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12816.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12816.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12816.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-12816.md","https://github.com/digitalbazaar/forge/blob/7a43db987bd0ecdc5b41f6d73f58ba6ca5bf9ae1/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4ed664b3934f99f1826b6f9477f6d9326cb30deb/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12816.json","https://github.com/teslamate-org/teslamate/blob/29b17112caf56f565810b076bbd7636275a27d8e/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4ed664b3934f99f1826b6f9477f6d9326cb30deb/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-12816.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0535.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0545","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0545.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12977","title":"Fluent Bit 输入插件标签键未过滤导致的日志注入与路径遍历漏洞","description":"tags as required.<value>Fluent Bit 的 in_http、in_splunk 及 in_elasticsearch 输入插件在接收日志数据时，未能对 tag_key 字段执行充分的输入清理与验证。具备对目标 Fluent Bit 实例网络访问权限，或能够向 Splunk/Elasticsearch 写入日志记录的攻击者，可向 tag_key 中注入包含换行符、../ 等特殊字符的非法值。由于 Fluent Bit 的标签机制直接控制日志的路由分发，且部分输出插件会将标签值用于生成文件名或日志内容，攻击者利用此漏洞可实现换行符注入导致日志伪造、路径遍历写入任意文件、伪造记录注入破坏数据完整性，或将日志错误路由至其他通道，严重影响日志系统的数据完整性与路由可靠性。该漏洞影响 Fluent Bit 4.0.12 及以下版本，CVSSv3.1 评分为 9.1，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12977"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-24T15:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:18Z","remediation":"立即将 Fluent Bit 升级至 v4.1.1 或 v4.0.13 版本，该版本已通过 PR #10967 修复 in_http、in_splunk 和 in_elasticsearch 插件中 tag_key 未做输入校验的问题。在升级前，可临时禁用受影响的输入插件，或在网络层面限制对 Fluent Bit 输入端点的访问，仅允许可信来源发送数据。同时检查现有配置中 tag_key 的使用方式，避免将用户可控数据直接作为标签键传入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fluentbit.io/blog/2025/10/28/security-vulnerabilities-addressed-in-fluent-bit-v4.1-and-backported-to-v4.0/","https://www.oligo.security/blog/critical-vulnerabilities-in-fluent-bit-expose-cloud-environments-to-remote-takeover","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ee7574df80bfcc012868b69b66762b8e0d540545/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12977.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/646633f7215f9c054bf866f39e723c4c5b80d95c/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12977.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/44a233c89001d09e9bb2630488b7c062d7f103ad/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12977.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/44a233c89001d09e9bb2630488b7c062d7f103ad/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12977.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12977.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12977.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4cd7841d39f8c59056b450c5339511feb54f9bc6/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-129xx/CVE-2025-12977.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/82fdd5be21708565a6180bac43d214b250676df9/2025/CVE-2025-12977.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-12977","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2025-12977"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0545.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0545.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0544","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0544.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12970","title":"Fluent Bit in_docker 输入插件 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Fluent Bit 日志处理工具的 in_docker 输入插件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。其 extract_name 函数在将容器名称复制到固定大小的栈缓冲区时，未对容器名长度进行有效校验。攻击者若具备创建容器或控制容器名称的权限，可通过提交超长容器名称触发缓冲区溢出，进而导致 Fluent Bit 进程崩溃，严重情况下可执行任意代码，造成数据泄露或服务器被控。该漏洞影响部署了受影响的 Fluent Bit 版本并使用 Docker 容器监控功能的系统环境，CVSS 评分为 8.8，危害等级为高。攻击者无需用户交互即可远程利用此漏洞，因此建议受影响用户尽快升级至官方修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12970"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-24T15:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:18Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Fluent Bit 至安全版本：4.0.x 分支升级至 v4.0.12 或更高版本，4.1.x 及后续分支升级至 v4.1.1 或更高版本。如暂时无法升级且无需 Docker 容器日志采集，可暂时禁用 in_docker 输入插件以消除攻击面。升级后重启 Fluent Bit 服务使补丁生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fluentbit.io/blog/2025/10/28/security-vulnerabilities-addressed-in-fluent-bit-v4.1-and-backported-to-v4.0/","https://www.oligo.security/blog/critical-vulnerabilities-in-fluent-bit-expose-cloud-environments-to-remote-takeover","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/187f9782052f1b70e6e7a8a5791a57c9e8021979/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12970.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1c86bb14047115fcac2be7eac34405d687b913be/2025/12xxx/